{"3374460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Causal Loop", "steam_appid": 3374460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4625880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exo-archaeologist Bale arrives on Tor Ulsat with his colleague Jen, an exo-linguist, to study the ruins of the lost Tor civilisation. But when he unwittingly activates the Chronolith - an ancient alien device - reality shatters. Jen vanishes, and Bale is trapped in a fractured world where time loops and echoes of the past and future bleed together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no way to contact mission control, Bale must navigate countless obstacles, unravel the fate of the Tor, and outwit the cryptic and mysterious forces that oppose him. As reality unravels and truth remains buried in the ruins, Bale's only hope is to solve the mystery of the Tor - before he's lost to the loop forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/c128d47e1f7453efc2902c7bc839428f.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record, re-record, and replay. Use the signature 'Echo Branching' mechanic to record your actions and engage with up to three echoes of your past self. Harness these duplicates to skillfully learn to manipulate ancient alien systems that once seemed impossible to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/038b824fb4f56a2a14a6e6225d59dcb1.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful environments through fifteen hand-crafted chapters filled with secrets that will allow you to unravel the mystery of this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/f6bd54bd18a1bfee4c1cdddc28b8cf76.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious alien planet through the lens of an emotional and thought-provoking story, with the puzzles always supporting the momentum of the underlying narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/3a77cbb3b98f31a777a4d31b5fd131d4.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character is fully voiced by a fantastic cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, we have placed a major focus on accessibility to ensure that all players are able to enjoy Causal Loop. The game includes accessibility options such as motion sickness prevention, colour blindness mode, control mapping, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/1916596af95aa3afe2e54d6a862ab343.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exo-archaeologist Bale arrives on Tor Ulsat with his colleague Jen, an exo-linguist, to study the ruins of the lost Tor civilisation. But when he unwittingly activates the Chronolith - an ancient alien device - reality shatters. Jen vanishes, and Bale is trapped in a fractured world where time loops and echoes of the past and future bleed together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no way to contact mission control, Bale must navigate countless obstacles, unravel the fate of the Tor, and outwit the cryptic and mysterious forces that oppose him. As reality unravels and truth remains buried in the ruins, Bale's only hope is to solve the mystery of the Tor - before he's lost to the loop forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/c128d47e1f7453efc2902c7bc839428f.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/8ac3e435883a65aec95a266eff49a43b.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record, re-record, and replay. Use the signature 'Echo Branching' mechanic to record your actions and engage with up to three echoes of your past self. Harness these duplicates to skillfully learn to manipulate ancient alien systems that once seemed impossible to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/038b824fb4f56a2a14a6e6225d59dcb1.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/4928d96310bd667fa8e45ec86c2430af.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful environments through fifteen hand-crafted chapters filled with secrets that will allow you to unravel the mystery of this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/f6bd54bd18a1bfee4c1cdddc28b8cf76.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/ee1841ecb7f474881b464b89cdbd903d.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious alien planet through the lens of an emotional and thought-provoking story, with the puzzles always supporting the momentum of the underlying narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/3a77cbb3b98f31a777a4d31b5fd131d4.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.poster.avif?t=1783441170\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.webm?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/extras/06788076cb14df55268b0e65445a70fd.mp4?t=1783441170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character is fully voiced by a fantastic cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, we have placed a major focus on accessibility to ensure that all players are able to enjoy Causal Loop. The game includes accessibility options such as motion sickness prevention, colour blindness mode, control mapping, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Causal Loop is a narrative puzzler that blends mind-bending mechanics with a rich sci-fi story about time, consequence, and survival. Solve intricate puzzles by using the signature “echo” mechanic to record, replay, and interact with up to three versions of your past self. Can you break the loop?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“At its best, it is thoughtful, quietly emotional, and deeply satisfying in a way that lingers after you stop playing.”<br>4/5 – Game Critix<br><br>“You genuinely feel smart when you finally crack a puzzle after a while, everything clicks into place, and you make it to the next section. On top of that, the game delivers an engaging story with multiple endings, strong voice acting, and plenty of secrets hidden throughout the world for you to discover.”<br>4/5 – ThreeTwoPlay<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/d8abe13a10d141f59febe8a24088b2e6f12c6b1e/header.jpg?t=1783441170", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/4303ed75900e87a28de70a73492065bda05e7a26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783441170", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374460/4303ed75900e87a28de70a73492065bda05e7a26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783441170", "website": "https://www.mirebound.com/causal-loop/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 TI or AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated audio or onboard sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These system requirements are for playing Causal Loop at 1080p resolution with medium settings, aiming for a stable 60 FPS. For lower resolutions or less demanding graphical settings, the game may run smoothly on systems with slightly lower specs.</li></ul>",